h, vocalized Hebrew transcription on Wikisource"}]},{"id":"1512:1:citation-08","he":[343,475],"en":[658,677],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tractate_Semachot_6.11"},"reference":"Tractate Semachot 6:11","assessment":"Semachot gives the received conjunctions, a personal scroll bought for 100 maneh, and the Temple circuit before it was found. Heilprin’s genealogy correction remains a proposal.","evidence":[{"reference":"Tractate Semachot 6:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Tractate_Semachot_6.11"},"witness":"Talmud Bavli, Vilna 1883 ed."},{"reference":"Sifrei Devarim 294:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sifrei_Devarim_294.9"},"witness":"Sefaria Vocalized Edition"},{"reference":"Mekhilta deRabbi Ishmael, BaChodesh 7","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/ביאור:מכילתא_מנוקדת_ומעוצבת/בחדש#:~:text=%D7%90%D6%B6%D7%9C%D6%B0%D7%A2%D6%B8%D7%96%D6%B8%D7%A8%20%D7%91%D6%B6%D6%BC%D7%9F%20%D7%97%D6%B2%D7%A0%D6%B7%D7%A0%D6%B0%D7%99%D6%B8%D7%94%20%D7%91%D6%B6%D6%BC%D7%9F%20%D7%97%D6%B4%D7%96%D6%B0%D7%A7%D6%B4%D7%99%D6%B8%D6%BC%D7%94"},"witness":"Mekhilta deRabbi Ishmael, BaChodesh, vocalized Hebrew transcription on Wikisource"}]},{"id":"1512:1:citation-09","he":[477,536],"en":[1018,1030],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat_13b.2"},"reference":"Shabbat 13b:2","assessment":"The Bavli’s Mishnah sets the visit and eighteen decrees in his upper chamber.","evidence":[{"reference":"Shabbat 13b:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat_13b.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Mishnah Shabbat 1:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Mishnah_Shabbat_1.4"},"witness":"Torat Emet 357"}]},{"id":"1512:1:citation-10","he":[537,605],"en":[1184,1196],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Menachot_45a.19"},"reference":"Menachot 45a:19","assessment":"Menachot and the Shabbat parallel have 300 jars of oil; Yuchasin also names oil for illumination. The Warsaw root has wine.","evidence":[{"refere